{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "title": "Data Quality - silver.transactions",
  "uid": "dq-poc-silver-transactions",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Contrat Soda - dernier résultat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "dq_contract_passed",
          "legendFormat": "{{dataset}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "dq_contract_passed (1 = pass, 0 = fail)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "dq_contract_passed",
          "legendFormat": "{{dataset}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Règles d'alerte à créer (Alerts & IRM)",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**1. Contrat en échec**\n\n```\ndq_contract_passed == 0\n```\n\n**2. Pipeline de contrôle silencieusement cassé (aucune métrique reçue)**\n\n```\nabsent_over_time(dq_contract_passed{dataset=\"lakehouse.silver.transactions\"}[1h])\n```\n\nRétention Grafana Cloud Free : 14 jours - l'historique long reste dans `dq_results` (Postgres) / Power BI."
      }
    }
  ]
}
